WEBVTT

00:00:09.370 --> 00:00:11.040
<i>In East Blue</i>

00:00:11.130 --> 00:00:14.400
<i>there was a man known as
the Great Gold Pirate.</i>

00:00:14.490 --> 00:00:16.080
<i>His name was Woonan.</i>

00:00:18.010 --> 00:00:20.000
<i>Through countless battles,</i>

00:00:20.090 --> 00:00:23.440
<i>Woonan robbed those with excessive gold.</i>

00:00:23.970 --> 00:00:27.720
<i>According to legend,
his crew acquired a mountain of gold,</i>

00:00:27.810 --> 00:00:31.960
<i>which glittered at night, emulating daytime.</i>

00:00:33.130 --> 00:00:35.560
<i>A few years ago, however,</i>

00:00:35.650 --> 00:00:38.450
<i>Woonan suddenly faded away.</i>

00:00:39.650 --> 00:00:42.000
<i>The Great Gold Pirate</i>

00:00:42.090 --> 00:00:45.480
<i>hid his treasure on a remote island, and died.</i>

00:00:46.090 --> 00:00:48.560
<i>That rumour remains intact to this day,</i>

00:00:48.650 --> 00:00:52.880
<i>and many pirates
continue to search for the island.</i>

00:00:54.290 --> 00:00:58.410
<i>There exists a map
created by one of Woonan's crew members.</i>

00:00:58.490 --> 00:01:01.680
<i>Whoever procures the map
will be able to find the island.</i>

00:01:01.770 --> 00:01:05.080
<i>They say the dazzling mountain of gold</i>

00:01:05.170 --> 00:01:07.890
<i>is buried on a legendary island.</i>

00:01:12.050 --> 00:01:14.880
The Great Gold Pirate...

00:01:32.330 --> 00:01:35.080
At last, I have it.

00:01:35.170 --> 00:01:36.920
Woonan's map.

00:01:49.490 --> 00:01:51.800
<i>Wealth, fame, power.</i>

00:01:51.890 --> 00:01:54.400
<i>The Pirate King
who attained everything in this world was</i>

00:01:54.490 --> 00:01:55.480
<i>Gold Roger.</i>

00:01:56.450 --> 00:01:58.280
<i>He left behind a treasure, One Piece,</i>

00:01:58.370 --> 00:01:59.640
<i>and in order to find it</i>

00:01:59.730 --> 00:02:02.040
<i>many men head towards the Grand Line.</i>

00:02:03.170 --> 00:02:05.480
<i>The world is entering the Great Pirate Age.</i>

00:02:06.690 --> 00:02:09.570
<i>Wearing the straw hat
given to him by the great pirate Shanks,</i>

00:02:09.890 --> 00:02:12.720
<i>Monkey D. Luffy
also begins a journey across the ocean,</i>

00:02:13.250 --> 00:02:17.000
<i>aiming to be the Pirate King!</i>

00:02:17.690 --> 00:02:22.720
<i>Arittake no yume wo kakiatsume </i>

00:02:17.690 --> 00:02:22.720
<i>Gather all your dreams.</i>

00:02:22.890 --> 00:02:28.280
<i>Sagashimono wo sagashi ni yuku no sa</i>

00:02:22.890 --> 00:02:28.280
<i>We'll find what we're looking for.</i>

00:02:28.780 --> 00:02:29.780
<i>One Piece</i>

00:02:35.050 --> 00:02:39.840
<i>Rashinban nante juutai no moto</i>

00:02:35.050 --> 00:02:39.840
<i>A compass will only delay us.</i>

00:02:40.610 --> 00:02:45.680
<i>Netsu ni ukasare kaji wo toru no sa</i>

00:02:40.610 --> 00:02:45.680
<i>We'll heat it up and take the helm.</i>

00:02:46.330 --> 00:02:51.320
<i>Hokori kabutteta takara no chizu mo </i>

00:02:46.330 --> 00:02:51.320
<i>Even a sooty treasure map</i>

00:02:51.650 --> 00:02:56.770
<i>Tashikameta no nara densetsu ja nai!</i>

00:02:51.650 --> 00:02:56.770
<i>can go from legend to reality.</i>

00:02:58.450 --> 00:03:04.000
<i>Kojinteki na arashi wa dareka no </i>

00:02:58.450 --> 00:03:04.000
<i>When your life is a storm,</i>

00:03:04.210 --> 00:03:09.080
<i>Baiorizumu nokkatte</i>

00:03:04.210 --> 00:03:09.080
<i>jump on someone else's biological rhythm.</i>

00:03:09.450 --> 00:03:11.760
<i>Omoisugoseba ii!</i>

00:03:09.450 --> 00:03:11.760
<i>It's OK to think too much!</i>

00:03:13.170 --> 00:03:18.320
<i>Arittake no yume wo kakiatsume </i>

00:03:13.170 --> 00:03:18.320
<i>Gather all your dreams.</i>

00:03:18.610 --> 00:03:23.810
<i>Sagashimono wo sagashi ni yuku no sa</i>

00:03:18.610 --> 00:03:23.810
<i>We'll find what we're looking for.</i>

00:03:24.330 --> 00:03:29.920
<i>Poketto no koin, soreto
You wanna be my friend? </i>

00:03:24.330 --> 00:03:29.920
<i>A pocket of coins...
So, do you wanna be my friend?</i>

00:03:30.610 --> 00:03:36.760
<i>We are, We are on the cruise! WE ARE!</i>

00:03:30.610 --> 00:03:36.760
<i>We are, we are on the cruise... we are!</i>

00:03:52.490 --> 00:03:55.210
I'm starving!

00:03:55.290 --> 00:03:57.960
The last time we ate was a week ago, right?

00:03:58.250 --> 00:04:00.080
The clouds look so tasty.

00:04:00.170 --> 00:04:02.040
I can't even drool any more.

00:04:02.890 --> 00:04:06.440
<i>The island of Gold,
where Woonan buried his treasure.</i>

00:04:06.530 --> 00:04:08.800
<i>If the information I gathered is correct,</i>

00:04:08.970 --> 00:04:10.530
<i>it should be around here.</i>

00:04:11.570 --> 00:04:14.640
<i>All I need is to find the treasure map...</i>

00:04:17.130 --> 00:04:18.960
Did you find anything to eat?

00:04:19.290 --> 00:04:21.640
Don't scare me like that, Luffy!

00:04:21.730 --> 00:04:24.160
What were you thinking!?

00:04:24.330 --> 00:04:26.440
Got it, got it, got it, I finally got it!

00:04:26.970 --> 00:04:27.920
This is it.

00:04:28.010 --> 00:04:30.040
It's no doubt the biggest fish in the world!

00:04:30.130 --> 00:04:32.930
Brace yourselves!
You'll eat it until your stomach explodes.

00:04:35.330 --> 00:04:36.560
Oh, well.

00:04:37.250 --> 00:04:39.360
No matter how many times
you make that joke, I won't fall for it.

00:04:39.450 --> 00:04:40.520
I got it, got it, got it!

00:04:41.130 --> 00:04:44.520
At this rate, we'll starve to death in two days.

00:04:44.650 --> 00:04:47.800
First of all, who's to blame for our hunger?

00:04:48.250 --> 00:04:49.480
I prepared for this long voyage

00:04:49.570 --> 00:04:51.200
by stocking up on a month's supply of food,

00:04:51.290 --> 00:04:53.040
yet you devoured it all in only three days!

00:04:53.130 --> 00:04:54.200
Luffy, was it you?

00:04:54.650 --> 00:04:55.640
Yup!

00:04:55.730 --> 00:04:56.320
Don't be proud of it!

00:04:56.810 --> 00:04:59.160
Go catch a bird or fish or something.

00:04:59.250 --> 00:05:00.520
You're just useless.

00:05:00.610 --> 00:05:02.010
What's this!

00:05:02.090 --> 00:05:02.720
It's empty-

00:05:02.810 --> 00:05:03.720
A grain of rice!

00:05:03.810 --> 00:05:04.920
What? No way...

00:05:05.010 --> 00:05:06.520
It must've stuck to the lid. Lucky!

00:05:06.610 --> 00:05:07.600
Stop! It's mine!

00:05:08.010 --> 00:05:10.400
Filthy! I was a fool...

00:05:10.610 --> 00:05:12.640
Why did I ever team up with these guys?

00:05:13.090 --> 00:05:14.440
Oh, hello.

00:05:14.530 --> 00:05:15.880
That's my treasure!

00:05:15.970 --> 00:05:16.920
Who are you guys?

00:05:17.010 --> 00:05:18.520
Excuse us, but we'll be taking our leave now.

00:05:18.890 --> 00:05:19.520
So long.

00:05:19.610 --> 00:05:21.240
Everyone, get over here! Thieves!

00:05:21.690 --> 00:05:23.520
Thieves? Are they bad fellows?

00:05:23.610 --> 00:05:27.040
Who knows...
That treasure was stolen to begin with.

00:05:27.130 --> 00:05:27.920
Probably.

00:05:28.010 --> 00:05:29.490
Yes, they're bad!

00:05:29.810 --> 00:05:32.040
I can offer you these instead of the treasure.

00:05:33.450 --> 00:05:35.960
Oh, these are delicious!

00:05:36.050 --> 00:05:36.840
Don't eat that!

00:05:37.250 --> 00:05:39.280
All right, come on kid!

00:05:40.450 --> 00:05:41.880
I know!

00:05:42.290 --> 00:05:44.600
Hey! Do you have any more rice balls?

00:05:51.570 --> 00:05:53.920
Hey, Nami! These guys are bad!

00:05:54.010 --> 00:05:55.760
Didn't I tell you that!

00:05:56.130 --> 00:05:58.320
Hey! You shot me!

00:05:58.410 --> 00:05:59.680
Isn't that a pistol!?

00:06:00.450 --> 00:06:01.850
I was certain that I hit him...

00:06:01.930 --> 00:06:02.680
Shoot him! Shoot him!

00:06:15.690 --> 00:06:17.760
Gum-Gum

00:06:18.010 --> 00:06:20.120
Rocket!

00:06:25.170 --> 00:06:26.320
What the?

00:06:42.130 --> 00:06:43.960
Damn it! I miscalculated.

00:06:44.050 --> 00:06:45.450
Wha... what is this guy!?

00:06:45.530 --> 00:06:47.800
It's like his entire body is made of rubber!

00:06:48.210 --> 00:06:48.920
Rubber?

00:06:49.330 --> 00:06:50.920
That's 'cos I'm a rubber man.

00:06:51.130 --> 00:06:52.280
Rubber man?

00:06:52.370 --> 00:06:53.320
No way...

00:06:53.410 --> 00:06:56.400
He has the same
Devil Fruit power as Mister El Drago?

00:06:56.730 --> 00:06:58.520
El Drago? Who's that?

00:07:01.490 --> 00:07:03.080
What are you doing?

00:07:03.170 --> 00:07:04.570
Hey, Luffy, be careful!

00:07:05.170 --> 00:07:05.800
That's...

00:07:11.210 --> 00:07:12.720
Mister El Drago!

00:07:12.810 --> 00:07:14.290
That stance... it can't be!

00:07:14.370 --> 00:07:16.280
The devil's power!

00:07:16.370 --> 00:07:17.960
Run away!

00:07:18.050 --> 00:07:19.530
Er... what?

00:07:19.610 --> 00:07:22.330
My treasure!

00:07:22.410 --> 00:07:24.240
- Kill them!
- Something's off about the guy on that ship.

00:07:57.850 --> 00:07:59.170
I thought I was gonna die.

00:07:59.250 --> 00:08:00.810
What the hell was that?

00:08:01.330 --> 00:08:02.520
I feel heavier somehow.

00:08:02.770 --> 00:08:04.680
Who is this guy? Is he with them?

00:08:04.770 --> 00:08:05.880
You're joking, right!?

00:08:06.130 --> 00:08:07.610
You're looking at the great pirate Tobio!

00:08:08.170 --> 00:08:09.730
- The great pirate Tobio?
- That's right!

00:08:09.810 --> 00:08:11.210
I was on a distant adventure,

00:08:11.290 --> 00:08:12.880
looking for the treasure island.

00:08:13.290 --> 00:08:14.690
But El Drago captured me,

00:08:14.770 --> 00:08:15.880
and made me work for him...

00:08:15.970 --> 00:08:16.680
Actually, that's wrong!

00:08:16.770 --> 00:08:18.280
I pretended to join them

00:08:18.370 --> 00:08:20.160
in order to find the Island of Gold.

00:08:20.570 --> 00:08:21.680
I'm starving.

00:08:21.770 --> 00:08:23.000
Is there somewhere to eat around here?

00:08:23.090 --> 00:08:24.080
Hey, are you listening?

00:08:28.530 --> 00:08:30.520
What is that delicious smell?

00:08:32.210 --> 00:08:33.640
Wha... what?

00:08:37.010 --> 00:08:38.800
What's going on?

00:08:39.130 --> 00:08:40.560
Oden!

00:08:41.130 --> 00:08:42.320
Oden?

00:08:53.290 --> 00:08:54.920
What's all the commotion about?

00:08:55.170 --> 00:08:56.040
Tobio!

00:08:56.890 --> 00:08:57.840
Grandpa Ganzo.

00:08:57.930 --> 00:09:00.080
How often will you run away from home
before you're satisfied?

00:09:00.170 --> 00:09:03.440
You always leave
and then come back like nothing happened.

00:09:03.530 --> 00:09:04.440
No, I don't!

00:09:04.530 --> 00:09:06.480
My henchmen said they were hungry,

00:09:06.570 --> 00:09:08.360
so I thought I'd feed them some oden.

00:09:08.450 --> 00:09:09.440
Henchmen?

00:09:09.530 --> 00:09:11.640
Hey! Don't just eat as you please!

00:09:12.490 --> 00:09:15.080
"Oden"

00:09:22.530 --> 00:09:24.200
Delicious!

00:09:24.290 --> 00:09:26.360
I've never had such delectable oden.

00:09:26.450 --> 00:09:28.440
Your grandpa is the greatest!

00:09:28.530 --> 00:09:30.160
He's just a stubborn geezer.

00:09:30.250 --> 00:09:31.440
Sure, his oden is good,

00:09:31.570 --> 00:09:33.000
but that's all he can do.

00:09:35.370 --> 00:09:38.520
All he does day after day is cook oden.

00:09:38.610 --> 00:09:40.720
Yet he barely gets any customers.

00:09:40.810 --> 00:09:42.290
I'm sick and tired of it.

00:09:43.810 --> 00:09:44.440
That was good!

00:09:44.530 --> 00:09:45.560
Eh? No more?

00:09:45.650 --> 00:09:46.720
Luffy, you bastard!

00:09:47.130 --> 00:09:49.160
When I grow up,
I'm going to be nothing like grandpa.

00:09:49.370 --> 00:09:51.360
I'm going to be a great pirate like Woonan!

00:09:51.450 --> 00:09:53.680
Woonan? The Great Gold Pirate?

00:09:54.010 --> 00:09:54.960
Ahh, that's mine!

00:09:55.690 --> 00:09:57.360
You scoundrel! I'm gonna beat you to death!

00:09:58.010 --> 00:09:59.680
They say the legendary pirate Woonan

00:09:59.770 --> 00:10:02.570
stole a third of the world's gold.

00:10:02.650 --> 00:10:05.320
But he only robbed despicable men,

00:10:05.450 --> 00:10:07.600
and would never steal from anyone else.

00:10:07.690 --> 00:10:09.800
He is a proud pirate.

00:10:10.730 --> 00:10:12.760
So you're saying he's strong, right?

00:10:13.330 --> 00:10:16.280
I thought he was already dead.

00:10:16.370 --> 00:10:17.000
He's alive!

00:10:17.090 --> 00:10:18.410
Woonan's invincible.

00:10:18.490 --> 00:10:21.440
He's on the Island of Gold right now.
I know it!

00:10:21.530 --> 00:10:25.040
I heard El Drago is going to the island.

00:10:25.130 --> 00:10:26.720
I'm almost certain of where it is.

00:10:26.810 --> 00:10:29.450
I'm going to meet Woonan
and ask to join his crew.

00:10:29.930 --> 00:10:32.880
All right!
I'm also going to meet this Woonan fellow.

00:10:33.610 --> 00:10:35.360
If he's a good bloke, I'll make him my friend.

00:10:37.250 --> 00:10:38.730
Are you serious!?

00:10:38.810 --> 00:10:41.280
Why would Woonan befriend you?

00:10:41.370 --> 00:10:42.160
That's because...

00:10:42.250 --> 00:10:43.600
I'm going to become the Pirate King.

00:10:44.050 --> 00:10:45.720
Pirate King?

00:10:45.810 --> 00:10:47.720
Yeah. I'm going to reach the Grand Line,

00:10:47.810 --> 00:10:50.920
and find the ultimate treasure, One Piece.

00:10:51.010 --> 00:10:53.120
Then I'll become the Pirate King.

00:10:53.210 --> 00:10:54.040
Once I'm king,

00:10:54.210 --> 00:10:57.360
it's only fitting that I have
such a legendary man as a comrade.

00:10:57.450 --> 00:10:58.600
Enough!

00:10:58.690 --> 00:11:01.200
Quit making weird jokes and say it straight!

00:11:01.290 --> 00:11:03.960
Just tell me I'm not good enough
and that I will never join Woonan's crew.

00:11:04.050 --> 00:11:05.370
What are you talking about?

00:11:06.010 --> 00:11:06.920
Hey, kid.

00:11:08.610 --> 00:11:10.360
I know it's hard to believe,

00:11:10.890 --> 00:11:11.920
but he's serious.

00:11:14.330 --> 00:11:15.810
Fellows...

00:11:16.170 --> 00:11:17.320
I don't care what you do,

00:11:17.410 --> 00:11:19.720
as long as you remember one crucial thing.

00:11:19.810 --> 00:11:21.400
What is it? The crucial thing.

00:11:21.770 --> 00:11:22.680
Do you...

00:11:22.770 --> 00:11:23.920
have any money?

00:11:24.890 --> 00:11:26.120
125 servings of fried tofu,

00:11:26.210 --> 00:11:27.480
153 bowls of seaweed noodles,

00:11:27.570 --> 00:11:28.640
302 fish balls,

00:11:28.730 --> 00:11:29.720
102 white radishes...

00:11:29.810 --> 00:11:30.880
Konjac, fish cakes, eggs,

00:11:30.970 --> 00:11:32.080
etc, etc...

00:11:33.050 --> 00:11:35.560
I, Ganzo, poured my soul into this oden.

00:11:35.650 --> 00:11:37.240
Altogether, it comes to 11 Berries.

00:11:37.330 --> 00:11:39.080
You'll have to pay in full.

00:11:39.370 --> 00:11:41.080
11 Berries!?

00:11:41.330 --> 00:11:42.320
Is that expensive?

00:11:42.410 --> 00:11:43.360
It's dirt cheap!

00:11:43.450 --> 00:11:44.720
Cheap enough to make your nose bleed!

00:11:44.810 --> 00:11:45.840
But...

00:11:46.090 --> 00:11:47.160
I don't have any money.

00:11:47.250 --> 00:11:48.160
No money!?

00:11:48.250 --> 00:11:49.120
Yup, none!

00:11:49.210 --> 00:11:50.240
Don't be proud of it!

00:11:50.410 --> 00:11:51.920
I guess we have no choice.

00:11:53.050 --> 00:11:53.560
Luffy?

00:11:54.130 --> 00:11:55.400
Thanks for the meal.

00:11:55.490 --> 00:11:56.840
Here's a token of my gratitude.

00:11:58.290 --> 00:11:59.610
That was good, mister.

00:11:59.690 --> 00:12:01.170
Thanks!

00:12:03.330 --> 00:12:04.920
Hey, Zoro! You coming?

00:12:06.010 --> 00:12:07.760
That's called...

00:12:09.050 --> 00:12:11.520
That's called eat and run!

00:12:13.570 --> 00:12:15.320
What did you just say?

00:12:15.930 --> 00:12:17.490
Do you have a problem

00:12:17.570 --> 00:12:19.640
with my voice training routine?

00:12:19.930 --> 00:12:21.840
Of course not, El Drago, sir.

00:12:21.930 --> 00:12:25.080
But it almost hit us, so...

00:12:25.570 --> 00:12:27.360
It's your fault for standing there!

00:12:27.810 --> 00:12:29.290
I... guess so.

00:12:29.450 --> 00:12:32.520
Oh, that's right.
We recently got a hold of some nice treasure.

00:12:32.610 --> 00:12:35.000
Is it gold? If not, throw it away.

00:12:35.090 --> 00:12:37.280
<i>Are you kidding me? That's my treasure!</i>

00:12:37.810 --> 00:12:41.080
Hey, can you see it yet? Is this the area?

00:12:41.210 --> 00:12:43.040
<i>That map... could it be?</i>

00:12:43.130 --> 00:12:44.160
I see it!

00:12:44.330 --> 00:12:45.400
The Island of Gold!

00:12:45.730 --> 00:12:47.560
Woonan's island!

00:12:47.810 --> 00:12:49.600
We've finally found it!

00:12:52.730 --> 00:12:54.520
<i>The Island of Gold...</i>

00:13:15.090 --> 00:13:17.240
<i>I've found the island.</i>

00:13:18.210 --> 00:13:20.600
<i>Now all I need is the map.</i>

00:13:21.690 --> 00:13:23.040
Going Merry!

00:13:23.210 --> 00:13:24.610
That means...

00:13:29.410 --> 00:13:30.160
That's...

00:13:37.530 --> 00:13:38.360
Usopp!

00:13:38.930 --> 00:13:42.040
I feel well-rested!

00:13:43.530 --> 00:13:45.360
I'm late, I'm late!

00:13:45.450 --> 00:13:47.280
I'm late for my date!

00:13:48.410 --> 00:13:49.920
Ouch!

00:13:50.530 --> 00:13:51.480
Who are you?

00:13:52.570 --> 00:13:55.290
If you don't know the famous Captain Usopp,

00:13:55.370 --> 00:13:57.160
you're not so great, after all!

00:13:57.330 --> 00:13:59.000
Maybe he's like us.

00:13:59.090 --> 00:14:01.200
He's probably just a treasure-hunting thug.

00:14:01.970 --> 00:14:04.080
<i>Treasure-hunting? What's going on?</i>

00:14:04.170 --> 00:14:05.920
<i>Who the hell are these guys?</i>

00:14:06.330 --> 00:14:07.360
Golass.

00:14:14.370 --> 00:14:15.600
Kill him!

00:14:15.770 --> 00:14:17.640
Kill? Wait just a minute!

00:14:18.090 --> 00:14:19.920
Stop! If you kill me,

00:14:20.010 --> 00:14:21.520
you won't know where to find the treasure!

00:14:21.610 --> 00:14:22.800
Ever!

00:14:22.890 --> 00:14:23.520
What!?

00:14:24.170 --> 00:14:26.440
You know where the treasure is?

00:14:26.770 --> 00:14:29.120
Yes, I know. Of course I know.

00:14:29.290 --> 00:14:31.520
I am the great Usopp,
a renowned treasure hunter.

00:14:31.610 --> 00:14:32.400
If you dig at a secret location,

00:14:32.490 --> 00:14:33.810
you'll find diamonds, rubies,

00:14:33.890 --> 00:14:35.000
sapphires, and a whole lot of other jewels...

00:14:35.330 --> 00:14:36.730
Diamonds and rubies...

00:14:36.890 --> 00:14:38.680
Sapphires and much more!

00:14:38.770 --> 00:14:39.800
Kill him!

00:14:40.690 --> 00:14:41.480
Why?

00:14:41.810 --> 00:14:44.450
What I want is...

00:14:44.530 --> 00:14:45.120
Gold!

00:14:46.050 --> 00:14:48.160
Gold! Of course!

00:14:48.250 --> 00:14:49.810
I know where a mountain of gold is buried!

00:14:50.090 --> 00:14:53.400
Gold! Gold!

00:14:54.570 --> 00:14:56.080
<i>What's going on with him?</i>

00:14:57.050 --> 00:14:58.240
Where is it?

00:14:58.650 --> 00:15:00.800
I will most certainly show you!

00:15:00.890 --> 00:15:04.040
But, it's impossible without a map.

00:15:04.290 --> 00:15:05.200
Here's a map.

00:15:05.730 --> 00:15:07.240
You really have one...

00:15:07.330 --> 00:15:08.890
This is a treasure map?

00:15:10.370 --> 00:15:13.600
"Great Pirate Woonan's Greatest Treasure."

00:15:13.850 --> 00:15:15.920
<i>Woonan's treasure?</i>

00:15:16.850 --> 00:15:17.920
"The treasure sleeps...

00:15:18.010 --> 00:15:19.280
"From the hills to the south...

00:15:19.370 --> 00:15:20.440
"if the whale faces west...

00:15:20.530 --> 00:15:21.480
"The ocean is..."

00:15:21.970 --> 00:15:23.800
Beyond that, we can't make out the writing.

00:15:24.290 --> 00:15:25.640
If the whale faces west,

00:15:26.170 --> 00:15:26.720
the tail points east.

00:15:28.090 --> 00:15:29.650
If the whale faces west,

00:15:29.730 --> 00:15:33.280
then obviously the tail points east,

00:15:33.370 --> 00:15:35.200
which means the treasure is to the east!

00:15:35.290 --> 00:15:38.280
I see, I see.

00:15:38.370 --> 00:15:39.960
These fellows aren't too bright.

00:15:40.170 --> 00:15:42.000
All right, let's go!

00:15:42.090 --> 00:15:43.120
Yes!

00:15:43.210 --> 00:15:44.880
Hey, wait! Am I going too?

00:15:44.970 --> 00:15:46.530
- Obviously.
- Really?

00:15:47.290 --> 00:15:49.240
This is making my heart race!

00:15:51.970 --> 00:15:53.200
It really is them!

00:15:55.690 --> 00:15:57.170
I'll pretend I saw nothing.

00:15:58.890 --> 00:15:59.880
Damn it, old man!

00:16:00.010 --> 00:16:01.920
You didn't have to take it this far!

00:16:02.010 --> 00:16:04.000
Didn't I tell you we'd work on your ship?

00:16:04.410 --> 00:16:06.480
Having the kid work is sufficient.

00:16:06.570 --> 00:16:08.000
People who eat and run have no right to talk.

00:16:08.090 --> 00:16:09.360
I didn't run!

00:16:09.450 --> 00:16:10.960
But can you pay your dues!?

00:16:11.090 --> 00:16:13.440
I see. Now I know
why you brought us to this island.

00:16:13.930 --> 00:16:16.280
You're going to make us look for gold.

00:16:16.370 --> 00:16:17.240
Shut up!

00:16:17.490 --> 00:16:18.440
Hey, Tobio!

00:16:18.530 --> 00:16:19.680
Could you catch that?

00:16:19.770 --> 00:16:21.040
It's important to me!

00:16:21.130 --> 00:16:21.480
Yeah!

00:16:22.090 --> 00:16:23.320
Get back to your chores!

00:16:23.930 --> 00:16:25.410
If you keep this up,

00:16:25.490 --> 00:16:27.280
you'll never become my successor!

00:16:27.370 --> 00:16:27.640
Huh?

00:16:28.090 --> 00:16:29.240
Don't tell me what to do!

00:16:29.330 --> 00:16:31.400
When did I say I wanted to be a cook?

00:16:31.970 --> 00:16:33.800
Don't back-talk! You're just a weak kid!

00:16:34.250 --> 00:16:36.000
Just do what I tell you!

00:16:36.090 --> 00:16:36.600
Quit it!

00:16:37.170 --> 00:16:38.730
All you ever do is talk about oden!

00:16:38.810 --> 00:16:40.130
Is oden really that important?

00:16:40.370 --> 00:16:41.480
Enough is enough!

00:16:41.570 --> 00:16:43.050
I'm going to find Woonan,

00:16:43.530 --> 00:16:45.240
and never return!

00:16:45.330 --> 00:16:46.480
Ahh, my hat!

00:16:46.650 --> 00:16:47.880
Wait! Give it back!

00:16:48.130 --> 00:16:49.120
Tobio!

00:16:50.570 --> 00:16:52.360
Mister, I'll definitely pay you for the oden!

00:16:52.450 --> 00:16:53.680
Don't worry!

00:16:59.770 --> 00:17:01.360
<i>Tobio...</i>

00:17:05.730 --> 00:17:07.800
<i>What the heck is this?</i>

00:17:08.450 --> 00:17:09.930
Isn't this a whale?

00:17:13.650 --> 00:17:15.800
If the whale faces west,

00:17:15.890 --> 00:17:17.480
the tail points east.

00:17:17.890 --> 00:17:19.680
That means the treasure is...

00:17:20.450 --> 00:17:21.440
...that over there?

00:17:22.570 --> 00:17:23.440
Tobio!

00:17:25.170 --> 00:17:26.280
The hat!

00:17:26.530 --> 00:17:27.880
Oh, that's right.

00:17:28.930 --> 00:17:29.920
That's better.

00:17:30.130 --> 00:17:31.800
Now let's go back, Zoro.

00:17:32.610 --> 00:17:33.880
What the... are you sleeping?

00:17:33.970 --> 00:17:35.040
I guess it can't be helped.

00:17:35.170 --> 00:17:36.730
You guys...

00:17:37.610 --> 00:17:41.490
One has to be strong
in order to join Woonan.

00:17:41.570 --> 00:17:42.560
Huh?

00:17:42.650 --> 00:17:43.880
As for me...

00:17:44.050 --> 00:17:46.200
I don't think I'm worthy.

00:17:46.810 --> 00:17:48.160
Then just become stronger!

00:17:49.130 --> 00:17:50.280
I have my ambitions,

00:17:50.370 --> 00:17:51.800
and you have yours.

00:17:52.130 --> 00:17:54.640
That's why you should
keep going towards those goals.

00:17:55.450 --> 00:17:56.480
You...

00:17:57.490 --> 00:17:58.600
What a simpleton.

00:17:59.210 --> 00:18:00.200
Catch you later.

00:18:02.690 --> 00:18:04.600
Which direction is the road back?

00:18:11.210 --> 00:18:12.360
Quickly, keep walking.

00:18:12.450 --> 00:18:13.800
I get it!

00:18:17.850 --> 00:18:19.280
The mountain of gold

00:18:19.370 --> 00:18:21.480
is no doubt near that castle we saw earlier.

00:18:21.610 --> 00:18:23.600
The question is, where in the castle?

00:18:23.690 --> 00:18:26.160
It's fine. This guy knows where it is, right?

00:18:27.130 --> 00:18:28.960
Of course I know.

00:18:29.050 --> 00:18:30.640
Woonan and I were close friends.

00:18:30.730 --> 00:18:32.360
What! You and Woonan?

00:18:32.970 --> 00:18:34.040
That's right!

00:18:34.290 --> 00:18:35.640
If you try to lay a hand on me,

00:18:35.730 --> 00:18:37.880
you'll have to answer to Woonan's crew.

00:18:40.970 --> 00:18:43.560
Woonan's crew is no longer in this world.

00:18:44.010 --> 00:18:45.520
What? What do you mean?

00:18:47.210 --> 00:18:49.360
He means we put an end to them

00:18:49.450 --> 00:18:50.400
with our own hands.

00:18:50.490 --> 00:18:51.970
What did you say?

00:18:52.330 --> 00:18:54.600
The last person we faced held the map.

00:18:54.690 --> 00:18:57.160
It shows the location of Woonan's gold...

00:18:57.250 --> 00:18:58.600
A map of the island.

00:18:58.690 --> 00:19:00.090
Now that the crew is gone,

00:19:00.170 --> 00:19:02.680
the gold naturally belongs to us.

00:19:03.010 --> 00:19:04.160
There is no "us".

00:19:05.370 --> 00:19:06.960
The gold is mine!

00:19:07.250 --> 00:19:08.810
Ah, that's right.

00:19:08.890 --> 00:19:11.450
The gold is all yours, El Drago, sir!

00:19:11.530 --> 00:19:12.400
We know that.

00:19:12.490 --> 00:19:13.720
- Where are you going?
- Eh?

00:19:14.530 --> 00:19:16.010
Trying to escape?

00:19:16.090 --> 00:19:17.960
No, I'm looking for the bathroom...

00:19:18.050 --> 00:19:20.520
Isn't this a breach of etiquette?

00:19:20.610 --> 00:19:22.200
This guy is suspicious, after all.

00:19:22.290 --> 00:19:24.360
Do you actually know where the gold is?

00:19:25.050 --> 00:19:26.320
You guys...

00:19:26.410 --> 00:19:28.360
Do I look like some kind of liar?

00:19:28.450 --> 00:19:30.720
Despite my appearance,
I'm a very honest bloke.

00:19:30.810 --> 00:19:31.560
Really?

00:19:31.650 --> 00:19:33.240
Really! Trust me on this.

00:19:33.770 --> 00:19:37.960
I haven't told a single lie since I was born.

00:19:39.610 --> 00:19:40.720
<i>This is bad...</i>

00:19:40.810 --> 00:19:42.130
<i>This is very bad.</i>

00:19:42.210 --> 00:19:44.680
<i>If I don't get a chance to escape...</i>

00:19:44.770 --> 00:19:46.200
El Drago, sir!

00:19:46.610 --> 00:19:49.720
What should we do? The road is blocked.

00:19:51.090 --> 00:19:52.840
Hey, hey, seriously?

00:19:52.930 --> 00:19:54.200
After coming this far, we have to detour?

00:19:54.650 --> 00:19:55.720
Don't panic!

00:19:55.810 --> 00:19:57.440
Golass.

00:20:02.530 --> 00:20:04.010
Step aside.

00:20:04.290 --> 00:20:06.080
Wha... what?

00:20:25.490 --> 00:20:26.400
No way!

00:20:36.010 --> 00:20:38.730
That was nothing for Golass.

00:20:38.810 --> 00:20:39.800
That's Golass for you!

00:20:46.410 --> 00:20:47.840
We're back here again.

00:20:47.930 --> 00:20:48.960
I tried to tell you!

00:20:49.290 --> 00:20:51.880
What'll we do now? We're lost!

00:20:52.010 --> 00:20:52.720
Don't be mad.

00:20:53.130 --> 00:20:56.920
Anyway, isn't Woonan's castle
somewhere on this island?

00:20:57.010 --> 00:20:58.490
We should look for it.

00:20:58.810 --> 00:21:02.040
Then why have we been
walking around in circles for so long?

00:21:02.130 --> 00:21:03.960
If I knew that, we wouldn't have this problem.

00:21:04.050 --> 00:21:04.720
What was that?

00:21:05.050 --> 00:21:06.280
Calm down.

00:21:06.370 --> 00:21:07.800
You'll get hungry if you're frustrated.

00:21:07.890 --> 00:21:08.640
He's right.

00:21:08.730 --> 00:21:10.560
You guys!

00:21:17.450 --> 00:21:18.520
Wow!

00:21:18.610 --> 00:21:20.120
This is Woonan's castle.

00:21:21.570 --> 00:21:23.360
So, where's the gold?

00:21:24.250 --> 00:21:24.920
Where!?

00:21:25.010 --> 00:21:26.720
<i>My stomach growls, growls.</i>

00:21:26.810 --> 00:21:28.240
<i>It growls!</i>

00:21:28.690 --> 00:21:32.600
<i>My stomach goes ”Pa pi pu pe po"!</i>

00:21:35.490 --> 00:21:36.200
Like that.

00:21:36.290 --> 00:21:37.690
What was that!?

00:21:38.570 --> 00:21:40.320
You were lying to us all along!

00:21:40.410 --> 00:21:41.040
What should we do?

00:21:41.450 --> 00:21:42.160
Kill him!

00:21:42.250 --> 00:21:42.680
Yes sir.

00:21:43.770 --> 00:21:45.120
Hey! Kamesuke!

00:21:45.330 --> 00:21:46.650
You traitor!

00:21:47.130 --> 00:21:47.840
Who are you?

00:21:47.930 --> 00:21:49.040
I'm Josephine.

00:21:49.130 --> 00:21:51.320
Granddaughter
of the Great Gold Pirate Woonan.

00:21:51.410 --> 00:21:52.080
Woonan's...?

00:21:52.170 --> 00:21:54.600
Kamesuke! You gave it away, didn't you?

00:21:54.690 --> 00:21:57.080
The fact that the mountain of gold is
hidden under this gate?

00:21:57.170 --> 00:21:58.800
Under this gate?

00:21:59.010 --> 00:22:00.960
<i>Under the gate, under the gate...</i>

00:22:01.730 --> 00:22:04.160
Young mistress, Josephine!

00:22:04.250 --> 00:22:06.240
What should we do now?

00:22:06.330 --> 00:22:09.280
If you dig under the gate for three days,

00:22:09.490 --> 00:22:10.760
you'll find the gold.

00:22:10.970 --> 00:22:13.320
I would never tell them something like that...

00:22:13.410 --> 00:22:14.360
Damn!

00:22:14.570 --> 00:22:16.440
- I've said too much!
<i>- This is overkill.</i>

00:22:16.610 --> 00:22:17.960
<i>They'll figure it out!</i>

00:22:18.490 --> 00:22:20.600
I see. So it's under this gate?

00:22:20.690 --> 00:22:22.360
<i>Hey!</i>

00:22:22.530 --> 00:22:23.850
<i>In any case, three days is plenty of time.</i>

00:22:23.930 --> 00:22:25.800
<i>I'll find the gold and run for it.</i>

00:22:25.890 --> 00:22:28.040
Let's start digging, sir.

00:22:28.130 --> 00:22:28.800
In three days...

00:22:28.890 --> 00:22:30.210
That won't be necessary.

00:22:30.290 --> 00:22:31.280
Huh?

00:22:31.690 --> 00:22:33.640
I'll get it done in ten seconds.

00:22:34.570 --> 00:22:36.560
It's coming. The devil's power!

00:22:37.530 --> 00:22:39.240
- What?
- This is bad. Nami, run!

00:22:47.890 --> 00:22:49.210
- Usopp!
- I'm fine.

00:22:49.290 --> 00:22:50.480
What is this guy...

00:22:50.650 --> 00:22:51.600
He's aiming this way!

00:22:56.090 --> 00:22:56.680
What's that?

00:22:56.770 --> 00:22:58.600
That... is Woonan's castle!

00:22:58.690 --> 00:23:00.120
So that's where Woonan is.

00:23:00.210 --> 00:23:00.720
Woonan!

00:23:00.810 --> 00:23:01.400
Tobio!

00:23:01.570 --> 00:23:02.560
Hold on to Zoro!

00:23:14.370 --> 00:23:15.770
This vocal technique...

00:23:15.850 --> 00:23:17.040
The Goe Goe Fruit!

00:23:17.130 --> 00:23:18.360
So it is a Devil Fruit power?

00:23:18.650 --> 00:23:21.080
It's a sound-based destructive power.

00:23:21.170 --> 00:23:22.570
The rumours were true...

00:23:22.690 --> 00:23:25.360
At this rate, the castle will be demolished.

00:23:25.450 --> 00:23:28.280
Who told him the gold was under there?

00:23:28.370 --> 00:23:29.320
You!

00:23:31.370 --> 00:23:33.200
If I destroy everything,

00:23:33.290 --> 00:23:35.040
eventually the gold will show up.

00:23:35.250 --> 00:23:37.320
Shut up!

00:23:38.490 --> 00:23:39.600
Quiet down, you lion!

00:23:39.690 --> 00:23:40.880
My ears hurt!

00:23:41.250 --> 00:23:41.920
Lion?

00:23:42.250 --> 00:23:44.200
Oh, sorry. You're a cat.

00:23:44.410 --> 00:23:46.360
Who the hell are you?

00:23:46.450 --> 00:23:49.330
Me? I'm Luffy, future Pirate King.

00:23:49.410 --> 00:23:50.480
By the way, this is Zoro.

00:23:50.570 --> 00:23:50.960
Yo.

00:23:51.130 --> 00:23:52.610
Woonan, are you there?

00:23:52.690 --> 00:23:53.800
Answer me if you're there!

00:23:53.970 --> 00:23:54.840
Woonan, are you there?

00:23:54.930 --> 00:23:56.360
Answer me if you're there!

00:23:57.370 --> 00:23:58.800
What are you talking about?

00:23:59.010 --> 00:24:00.840
That guy kicked the bucket ages ago.

00:24:02.370 --> 00:24:04.280
You can't be sure of that until you see him.

00:24:04.570 --> 00:24:07.560
Even if only one person believes it,

00:24:07.970 --> 00:24:10.080
he may still be alive!

00:24:10.810 --> 00:24:13.320
What are you rambling about?

00:24:13.690 --> 00:24:16.330
Hey, why are those two tied up?

00:24:16.810 --> 00:24:18.130
Move!

00:24:18.290 --> 00:24:19.880
I will protect Woonan's gold!

00:24:20.410 --> 00:24:21.280
Hey, hey...

00:24:21.370 --> 00:24:25.440
The precious gold
Woonan risked his life for, is on this island.

00:24:25.530 --> 00:24:28.120
You think I'd let
a villain like you do as you please?

00:24:28.610 --> 00:24:30.090
Get off this island!

00:24:35.210 --> 00:24:36.640
You want to die?

00:24:45.090 --> 00:24:46.440
You bastard!

00:24:49.450 --> 00:24:51.400
You're rather skilful,

00:24:51.490 --> 00:24:53.000
but I won't lose!

00:25:05.370 --> 00:25:07.120
What's wrong, huh?

00:25:07.730 --> 00:25:09.680
If I had three swords...

00:25:12.650 --> 00:25:14.080
Hey Luffy, don't stop me.

00:25:14.170 --> 00:25:14.880
Let me kill him!

00:25:15.450 --> 00:25:16.520
I'm not stopping you.

00:25:27.970 --> 00:25:29.400
What was that?

00:25:30.730 --> 00:25:33.200
What happened to Josephine and Kamesuke?

00:25:33.610 --> 00:25:35.520
Oh? Where'd they go?

00:25:40.410 --> 00:25:42.240
Luffy! Zoro!

00:25:42.370 --> 00:25:44.800
What is this? What's happening?

00:25:45.210 --> 00:25:47.200
Good grief, you are so troublesome.

00:25:47.290 --> 00:25:48.610
Are you OK, kid?

00:25:51.330 --> 00:25:52.360
All done.

00:25:52.890 --> 00:25:54.000
We're saved!

00:25:54.610 --> 00:25:57.280
Say, Nami. Could you lend me some money?

00:25:57.370 --> 00:25:58.240
What for?

00:25:58.650 --> 00:26:00.130
They didn't pay.

00:26:00.770 --> 00:26:01.800
The place should go bankrupt.

00:26:01.890 --> 00:26:03.040
It's just an oden shop!

00:26:03.410 --> 00:26:04.480
Who is this boy?

00:26:04.570 --> 00:26:05.320
Tobio.

00:26:05.410 --> 00:26:07.280
Who's Tobio?

00:26:07.370 --> 00:26:08.480
Tobio is Tobio.

00:26:08.850 --> 00:26:10.880
That's not what I meant!

00:26:13.330 --> 00:26:14.560
Woonan's castle is...!

00:26:18.730 --> 00:26:20.880
The gold's under the rubble, I suppose.

00:26:20.970 --> 00:26:23.080
What? You want the gold, too?

00:26:23.170 --> 00:26:25.280
No, it's not like that!

00:26:25.370 --> 00:26:27.240
The gold belongs to Woonan.

00:26:27.410 --> 00:26:28.600
If he's alive, that is...

00:26:28.690 --> 00:26:29.520
He is alive!

00:26:29.930 --> 00:26:31.560
The gold isn't there,

00:26:31.650 --> 00:26:32.880
and neither is Woonan.

00:26:33.050 --> 00:26:34.040
How do you know that?

00:26:34.250 --> 00:26:35.280
Didn't you notice?

00:26:35.370 --> 00:26:37.640
There wasn't a trace of life in that castle.

00:26:38.210 --> 00:26:39.720
It's most likely a decoy.

00:26:40.130 --> 00:26:42.280
Woonan is probably elsewhere.

00:26:42.610 --> 00:26:44.400
Is that the treasure map?

00:26:44.490 --> 00:26:45.480
Treasure map?

00:26:45.690 --> 00:26:47.960
That's right. This is the legendary map.

00:26:48.050 --> 00:26:50.040
They say it was left by one of Woonan's crew.

00:26:50.130 --> 00:26:51.320
When did you...?

00:26:51.410 --> 00:26:52.760
Who do you think I am?

00:26:54.130 --> 00:26:55.530
Hey, what are you doing?

00:26:55.610 --> 00:26:57.010
Just watch.

00:26:57.610 --> 00:26:59.120
If my intuition is correct,

00:26:59.210 --> 00:27:00.800
then surely...

00:27:01.330 --> 00:27:02.200
Invisible ink?

00:27:02.290 --> 00:27:03.280
Exactly!

00:27:03.370 --> 00:27:05.080
It's a simple trick.

00:27:05.210 --> 00:27:06.240
Look!

00:27:06.330 --> 00:27:07.810
Something's starting to appear!

00:27:08.730 --> 00:27:10.720
This... this is...!

00:27:18.170 --> 00:27:19.840
Nami!

00:27:20.130 --> 00:27:21.960
Come, let's get to the Grand Line!

00:27:22.050 --> 00:27:23.120
Don't try to trick us!

00:27:24.650 --> 00:27:27.120
What are we to do? We have no map...

00:27:27.210 --> 00:27:28.800
Woonan's clue is gone...

00:27:28.930 --> 00:27:32.040
Wasn't there something written on the map?

00:27:32.130 --> 00:27:33.560
Oh yeah...

00:27:33.770 --> 00:27:34.680
If I remember correctly...

00:27:35.090 --> 00:27:36.490
"The treasure sleeps...

00:27:36.570 --> 00:27:38.080
"From the hills to the south...

00:27:38.170 --> 00:27:39.320
"if the whale faces west...

00:27:39.410 --> 00:27:40.640
"the tail points east."

00:27:40.970 --> 00:27:41.960
Eh, really?

00:27:42.530 --> 00:27:44.440
Woonan's castle is to the east.

00:27:44.530 --> 00:27:45.480
Other than that...

00:27:45.570 --> 00:27:47.240
The tail points east?

00:27:49.810 --> 00:27:52.120
Ahh, it's not pointing east!

00:27:52.530 --> 00:27:53.930
That means the location is...

00:27:59.250 --> 00:28:00.200
there.

00:28:05.970 --> 00:28:07.320
Don't fall!

00:28:08.450 --> 00:28:10.010
If we could just climb this cliff,

00:28:11.130 --> 00:28:12.640
we'll definitely...

00:28:12.730 --> 00:28:14.600
We'll surely be able to meet Woonan!

00:28:14.930 --> 00:28:16.560
<i>If he's alive...</i>

00:28:16.770 --> 00:28:19.000
<i>Either way, I'll be getting the treasure.</i>

00:28:23.770 --> 00:28:25.280
Are you OK?

00:28:25.810 --> 00:28:27.760
It's too difficult for the kid.

00:28:28.130 --> 00:28:29.840
No, it's not.

00:28:29.930 --> 00:28:32.000
If I quit now,

00:28:32.090 --> 00:28:34.920
I'll never join Woonan's crew!

00:28:35.010 --> 00:28:36.410
Stop moving around or we'll fall!

00:28:36.690 --> 00:28:40.040
Hey, this is a good place to rest!

00:28:43.810 --> 00:28:44.680
Grandpa!

00:28:44.770 --> 00:28:46.600
What are you guys doing here?

00:28:49.370 --> 00:28:50.520
I see.

00:28:50.610 --> 00:28:52.600
The treasure map...

00:28:52.690 --> 00:28:54.280
Why are you here, mister?

00:28:55.090 --> 00:28:57.280
Burying treasure as high as possible...

00:28:57.370 --> 00:28:59.040
That's his way of doing things.

00:28:59.130 --> 00:29:00.690
And this is the only possible place to do it.

00:29:00.770 --> 00:29:01.800
Grandpa...

00:29:02.090 --> 00:29:03.650
You know about Woonan?

00:29:03.730 --> 00:29:05.050
Have you met him?

00:29:08.570 --> 00:29:09.970
He and I were like brothers.

00:29:10.050 --> 00:29:12.200
We grew up in the same village.

00:29:26.970 --> 00:29:29.800
Woonan! Of course you're here.

00:29:29.890 --> 00:29:31.880
It's ready! I made it myself today.

00:29:31.970 --> 00:29:33.370
Cut it out, Ganzo!

00:29:33.450 --> 00:29:35.080
You think I'd eat oden made by you?

00:29:35.170 --> 00:29:37.320
What did you say? You haven't even tried it...

00:29:37.410 --> 00:29:38.200
How do you know you won't like it?

00:29:38.290 --> 00:29:40.480
Since when are you such a coward?

00:29:40.570 --> 00:29:42.400
Open your eyes, Ganzo.

00:29:42.610 --> 00:29:43.400
What are you talking about?

00:29:43.490 --> 00:29:44.970
Look at this gold!

00:29:45.130 --> 00:29:46.640
My old man spent his entire life mining gold

00:29:46.730 --> 00:29:48.320
just for this.

00:29:48.530 --> 00:29:49.800
His entire life!

00:29:50.210 --> 00:29:52.560
This is all he got out of it!

00:29:53.010 --> 00:29:56.040
I refuse to live a stupid life like that.

00:29:56.410 --> 00:29:57.600
I'm going to become a pirate,

00:29:57.690 --> 00:30:00.330
and devote myself
to stealing gold from evildoers!

00:30:00.690 --> 00:30:02.170
Ganzo, you should come too.

00:30:02.370 --> 00:30:05.360
You're worthy of being my right-hand man.

00:30:05.970 --> 00:30:07.450
Gold?

00:30:07.530 --> 00:30:08.360
How foolish...

00:30:08.450 --> 00:30:09.480
What?

00:30:09.610 --> 00:30:11.760
Your father was a good person.

00:30:12.330 --> 00:30:14.560
He taught me how to make oden,

00:30:14.650 --> 00:30:16.160
and a number of other things.

00:30:16.250 --> 00:30:18.120
You're kidding! He's just a plain drunkard.

00:30:18.970 --> 00:30:20.560
I realised something.

00:30:20.890 --> 00:30:22.520
Gold doesn't laugh,

00:30:22.610 --> 00:30:23.720
drink alcohol,

00:30:23.810 --> 00:30:25.240
or sing songs.

00:30:25.330 --> 00:30:26.240
It doesn't cry either.

00:30:26.330 --> 00:30:28.400
It might as well be a rock.

00:30:28.490 --> 00:30:29.560
A rock?

00:30:29.930 --> 00:30:31.330
Your father

00:30:31.410 --> 00:30:33.080
said my oden was delicious.

00:30:33.570 --> 00:30:35.200
I decided then and there,

00:30:35.290 --> 00:30:39.410
that I would dedicate my life
to making the world's best oden.

00:30:39.770 --> 00:30:42.000
You idiot, idiot, idiot!

00:30:42.090 --> 00:30:44.120
You're going to waste your life for that?

00:30:44.250 --> 00:30:46.810
A man's purpose in life
is to follow great dreams!

00:30:47.130 --> 00:30:49.280
Listen up.
I want you to swear on this pirate flag,

00:30:49.370 --> 00:30:50.600
and come with me!

00:30:50.690 --> 00:30:52.800
We'll seize all the gold in this world!

00:30:52.970 --> 00:30:54.160
No way!

00:30:54.250 --> 00:30:55.920
Stubborn fool!

00:30:56.090 --> 00:30:57.520
What did you call me?

00:31:04.610 --> 00:31:07.200
Do you think you can
match my strength, Ganzo?

00:31:09.050 --> 00:31:10.640
Shit!

00:31:17.290 --> 00:31:18.610
Woonan!

00:31:24.650 --> 00:31:26.520
All right. Ganzo, don't let go.

00:31:26.610 --> 00:31:28.440
Pull slowly, just like that.

00:31:45.530 --> 00:31:46.640
Woonan.

00:31:46.730 --> 00:31:47.800
Are you OK?

00:32:03.330 --> 00:32:04.320
Woonan.

00:32:06.050 --> 00:32:08.200
Your flag is going to rip.

00:32:08.570 --> 00:32:10.080
What the hell are you saying?

00:32:10.170 --> 00:32:11.730
If you weren't complaining in the first place,

00:32:11.810 --> 00:32:13.210
maybe this wouldn't have happened.

00:32:13.290 --> 00:32:13.640
Hey...

00:32:13.730 --> 00:32:14.560
What is it?

00:32:14.650 --> 00:32:16.720
Hold on to your dreams.

00:32:27.010 --> 00:32:30.120
Ganzo!

00:32:32.410 --> 00:32:33.160
And then,

00:32:33.410 --> 00:32:34.560
did you die?

00:32:34.650 --> 00:32:36.400
He's alive, you idiot!

00:32:36.490 --> 00:32:39.720
A ship happened to pass by.

00:32:39.810 --> 00:32:42.800
They say it was the first time
there was such a miracle in the village.

00:32:43.010 --> 00:32:43.520
What?

00:32:43.610 --> 00:32:44.600
You didn't die?

00:32:44.690 --> 00:32:46.360
Of course not!

00:32:47.330 --> 00:32:51.040
When I woke up three days later,

00:32:51.130 --> 00:32:53.690
it was too late. Woonan had already left.

00:32:53.770 --> 00:32:57.810
After that, we never saw each other again.

00:32:58.730 --> 00:33:00.640
I had no idea.

00:33:00.730 --> 00:33:01.800
Grandpa...

00:33:02.290 --> 00:33:04.760
Meanwhile, the Woonan from memory

00:33:05.050 --> 00:33:07.480
remained the same stubborn blockhead

00:33:07.570 --> 00:33:09.840
who refused to eat my oden.

00:33:09.930 --> 00:33:11.000
However,

00:33:11.170 --> 00:33:11.880
if he were here now,

00:33:11.970 --> 00:33:17.360
I get the feeling he would eat my oden,
into which I've poured my life.

00:33:18.130 --> 00:33:20.320
Oden, into which you poured your life...

00:33:20.730 --> 00:33:23.120
Now then, let's not waste our time here.

00:33:23.250 --> 00:33:24.570
The oden will get cold.

00:33:24.770 --> 00:33:26.360
All right, let's go!

00:33:26.450 --> 00:33:27.040
Agreed.

00:33:27.130 --> 00:33:28.200
We're going!

00:33:32.210 --> 00:33:33.080
A cabin!

00:33:39.250 --> 00:33:40.000
There's nothing here.

00:33:40.090 --> 00:33:41.160
This is...

00:33:42.530 --> 00:33:44.090
It's empty here, too.

00:33:44.170 --> 00:33:45.680
Is Woonan really here?

00:33:46.170 --> 00:33:48.040
No chairs, desks, or anything...

00:33:48.410 --> 00:33:51.440
Only a common fireplace.

00:34:01.010 --> 00:34:02.160
Whoa!

00:34:02.330 --> 00:34:04.440
That's a cool trick.
What an amazing discovery, Zoro!

00:34:04.530 --> 00:34:06.320
All I did was look!

00:34:06.490 --> 00:34:08.200
Hey, look! You can go down from here.

00:34:08.290 --> 00:34:09.280
It's a basement.

00:34:09.370 --> 00:34:11.360
Woonan's probably down below.

00:34:11.610 --> 00:34:13.170
Together with his gold.

00:34:14.570 --> 00:34:15.720
Watch out!

00:34:35.650 --> 00:34:38.400
"If the whale faces west, the tail points east."

00:34:38.490 --> 00:34:40.000
It was nothing but a lie!

00:34:40.410 --> 00:34:41.810
Ah, this is bad...

00:34:45.210 --> 00:34:47.120
El Drago, sir! There's an entrance.

00:34:48.490 --> 00:34:50.050
So that's where the gold is?

00:34:50.130 --> 00:34:51.960
All right, bring it to me!

00:34:52.090 --> 00:34:52.840
Yes sir!

00:34:52.930 --> 00:34:53.640
Stop!

00:34:56.530 --> 00:34:57.080
Mister!

00:34:57.170 --> 00:34:58.000
Grandpa!

00:35:02.090 --> 00:35:03.200
What's this?

00:35:03.290 --> 00:35:04.360
Gold?

00:35:08.810 --> 00:35:10.040
Stop!

00:35:10.690 --> 00:35:15.280
Grandpa poured his life
into that oden just for Woonan.

00:35:15.490 --> 00:35:17.920
If you lay one finger on it...

00:35:27.330 --> 00:35:28.600
Was that satisfactory?

00:35:35.770 --> 00:35:37.680
Do you want to die?

00:35:38.330 --> 00:35:39.400
Tobio!

00:35:43.570 --> 00:35:45.320
Who the hell are you?

00:36:13.130 --> 00:36:14.400
Yum!

00:36:14.490 --> 00:36:17.290
The old man's oden is
undoubtedly the best in the world!

00:36:20.970 --> 00:36:23.120
I won't forgive you!

00:36:23.970 --> 00:36:25.290
What are you on about?

00:36:25.370 --> 00:36:27.240
Kill them, Golass!

00:36:29.250 --> 00:36:29.720
Zoro!

00:36:30.330 --> 00:36:32.360
I'll face this guy.

00:36:36.890 --> 00:36:37.880
H... hey!

00:36:37.970 --> 00:36:39.480
That three sword technique...

00:36:39.970 --> 00:36:41.160
It's Zoro!

00:36:41.250 --> 00:36:44.360
The pirate hunter, Roronoa Zoro!

00:36:47.610 --> 00:36:49.120
Whoever he is,

00:36:49.210 --> 00:36:52.200
when it comes to swords,
nobody's superior to Golass.

00:36:52.330 --> 00:36:54.040
Golass, slice him to shreds!

00:36:54.130 --> 00:36:56.240
You'll get 200 pieces of gold for every slice.

00:36:56.330 --> 00:36:58.200
500 pieces if you kill him!

00:37:13.530 --> 00:37:15.320
Damn, he's powerful!

00:37:15.610 --> 00:37:18.600
Go, Golass! I'll give you 1,000 gold pieces!

00:37:22.490 --> 00:37:23.760
Zoro!

00:37:28.130 --> 00:37:29.560
Die!

00:37:32.490 --> 00:37:34.760
What are you ashamed of?

00:37:36.010 --> 00:37:39.320
Deep down,
you don't want to murder for that guy.

00:37:39.570 --> 00:37:41.240
Aren't you thinking that?

00:37:43.370 --> 00:37:44.600
Those eyes...

00:37:44.690 --> 00:37:47.570
They are filled with shame
at drawing your sword for gold.

00:37:47.810 --> 00:37:50.120
You've thrown away
the pride that comes with wielding a sword.

00:37:51.810 --> 00:37:53.210
Golass, what are you doing?

00:37:53.290 --> 00:37:53.800
Kill him!

00:37:57.690 --> 00:37:59.200
You are certainly skilled.

00:37:59.370 --> 00:38:01.720
But without pride,

00:38:01.930 --> 00:38:03.720
your sword slows down for just a moment.

00:38:04.090 --> 00:38:07.080
And that moment makes all the difference!

00:38:21.450 --> 00:38:22.720
I left your vitals intact.

00:38:23.370 --> 00:38:26.520
When you reclaim
the pride in your sword, find me.

00:38:26.730 --> 00:38:27.880
We'll have a rematch.

00:38:30.610 --> 00:38:31.800
That guy.

00:38:31.890 --> 00:38:33.880
He's incredibly strong!

00:38:34.010 --> 00:38:36.760
There's still more to come.
It's too early to be in shock.

00:38:40.970 --> 00:38:42.600
Now it's your turn.

00:38:42.970 --> 00:38:46.320
You've angered me!

00:38:48.010 --> 00:38:49.200
This is bad. Get away!

00:38:52.410 --> 00:38:53.730
What?

00:39:00.530 --> 00:39:01.600
A direct hit!

00:39:09.010 --> 00:39:11.120
Gum-Gum

00:39:11.450 --> 00:39:13.520
Rocket!

00:39:17.730 --> 00:39:19.160
You bastard!

00:39:19.250 --> 00:39:20.730
Stop messing around!

00:39:21.610 --> 00:39:22.960
What on earth is he...

00:39:23.050 --> 00:39:28.280
Luffy ate a Devil Fruit: the Gum Gum Fruit.
Now he's a rubber man.

00:39:28.570 --> 00:39:31.840
He had the power of the Devil Fruit all along?

00:39:33.810 --> 00:39:35.320
Gum-Gum

00:39:35.530 --> 00:39:36.960
Pistol!

00:39:37.130 --> 00:39:37.680
He did it!

00:39:37.810 --> 00:39:39.000
No, not yet.

00:39:40.290 --> 00:39:42.280
Ouch, let go!

00:39:44.490 --> 00:39:45.560
What are you doing?

00:39:51.170 --> 00:39:53.200
This bastard's technique is...!

00:39:54.210 --> 00:39:55.200
Eh!

00:40:03.290 --> 00:40:05.960
Oh no.
If a rubber man gets cut, it's the end for him.

00:40:30.610 --> 00:40:31.640
Luffy!

00:40:35.970 --> 00:40:38.720
Gum-Gum

00:40:39.010 --> 00:40:40.640
Bell!

00:40:43.570 --> 00:40:44.680
El Drago, sir!

00:40:44.810 --> 00:40:45.880
Yes!

00:40:55.130 --> 00:40:55.640
Bastard!

00:40:56.690 --> 00:40:57.800
Gum-Gum

00:40:57.890 --> 00:40:59.210
Gatling!

00:41:05.250 --> 00:41:07.000
Gum-Gum

00:41:07.130 --> 00:41:08.960
Whip!

00:41:10.410 --> 00:41:12.480
Sir El Drago's gold armour...

00:41:12.570 --> 00:41:13.600
It broke!

00:41:13.890 --> 00:41:15.240
Incredible!

00:41:21.490 --> 00:41:24.440
The gold is mine!

00:42:10.690 --> 00:42:13.960
The gold... is mine...

00:42:14.170 --> 00:42:16.120
Gum-Gum

00:42:16.210 --> 00:42:17.530
Go!

00:42:17.610 --> 00:42:19.240
Bazooka!

00:42:29.610 --> 00:42:32.720
Sir El Drago...

00:42:33.610 --> 00:42:35.360
lost.

00:42:41.330 --> 00:42:42.560
We'll be running away now!

00:42:42.770 --> 00:42:43.360
Excuse us!

00:42:43.450 --> 00:42:44.440
Ahh!

00:42:45.010 --> 00:42:46.920
Hey, wait! Stop!

00:42:49.250 --> 00:42:51.400
I tried to tell you...

00:42:57.050 --> 00:42:58.610
Thanks, Tobio.

00:42:59.450 --> 00:43:00.560
Mister, I almost forgot.

00:43:00.650 --> 00:43:04.240
Sorry about that. I ate all of Woonan's oden.

00:43:05.250 --> 00:43:07.890
You'll get a stomach ache from all that.

00:43:07.970 --> 00:43:10.280
I won't get a stomach ache. I'm a pirate!

00:43:32.650 --> 00:43:34.320
We're finally going to meet Woonan.

00:43:34.810 --> 00:43:35.920
Ah...

00:43:41.650 --> 00:43:42.800
We're here.

00:43:43.770 --> 00:43:46.650
Woonan is on the other side of this door.

00:43:49.610 --> 00:43:50.680
I'm opening it.

00:44:10.370 --> 00:44:12.760
This is...? This is...?

00:44:15.530 --> 00:44:17.480
No! That's not Woonan!

00:44:17.570 --> 00:44:18.200
It's a fake.

00:44:18.930 --> 00:44:20.200
He's definitely somewhere...

00:44:26.570 --> 00:44:28.080
Grandpa...

00:44:30.010 --> 00:44:32.040
Hey, what is this?

00:44:40.490 --> 00:44:43.320
There's no mistaking it,
that's Woonan's writing.

00:44:44.050 --> 00:44:47.160
"To those who are here in search of gold,

00:44:47.370 --> 00:44:48.600
"my name is Woonan,

00:44:48.690 --> 00:44:51.920
"the man formerly known
as the Great Gold Pirate."

00:44:52.010 --> 00:44:53.680
Formerly? What does that mean?

00:44:54.330 --> 00:44:57.440
"But now I'm just a man waiting to die.

00:44:57.530 --> 00:45:01.650
"I've returned the gold to its original owners.

00:45:02.610 --> 00:45:04.480
"I have fought.

00:45:04.570 --> 00:45:06.480
"And I have achieved my childhood dream.

00:45:07.290 --> 00:45:11.170
<i>“I built a mountain of gold,
the likes of which no one has ever seen.</i>

00:45:11.290 --> 00:45:13.200
<i>“But as I sat in front of it,</i>

00:45:13.290 --> 00:45:16.480
<i>"I recalled what a man once said to me.</i>

00:45:16.970 --> 00:45:20.000
<i>“Gold doesn't laugh.
It might as well be a rock.'</i>

00:45:20.530 --> 00:45:23.920
<i>“He was right.
Though I devoted my whole life to it,</i>

00:45:24.450 --> 00:45:26.120
<i>”gold wasn't what I truly wanted.</i>

00:45:26.290 --> 00:45:29.440
<i>“It was the adventure
that came from looking for it.</i>

00:45:33.210 --> 00:45:35.280
"There's no gold here any more,

00:45:35.370 --> 00:45:38.280
"but there's a treasure far more valuable.

00:45:38.450 --> 00:45:41.120
"It may be worthless to someone else,

00:45:41.250 --> 00:45:43.400
"but this is all I need.

00:45:44.330 --> 00:45:47.080
"Please don't destroy this spot.

00:45:47.170 --> 00:45:50.960
"It's the resting place
of my most important treasure."

00:45:57.690 --> 00:45:59.280
<i>Ganzo.</i>

00:46:00.650 --> 00:46:02.600
<i>Ever since you saved my life that day,</i>

00:46:04.370 --> 00:46:06.800
<i>you've remained inside my heart.</i>

00:46:06.970 --> 00:46:08.840
<i>You were there on the boat,</i>

00:46:08.930 --> 00:46:12.720
<i>together with me on those long journeys.</i>

00:46:14.130 --> 00:46:15.120
<i>That's why</i>

00:46:15.930 --> 00:46:19.520
<i>I have no regrets
about living a life of adventure.</i>

00:46:22.010 --> 00:46:23.360
Woonan.

00:46:25.690 --> 00:46:28.200
Your grandpa is an amazing guy!

00:46:28.610 --> 00:46:32.840
He was the only man
the legendary pirate trusted!

00:46:33.610 --> 00:46:35.200
One of them is a great pirate.

00:46:35.290 --> 00:46:36.640
The other sells oden.

00:46:37.130 --> 00:46:38.120
But.

00:46:38.210 --> 00:46:40.850
They had the same amount of pride.

00:46:41.330 --> 00:46:42.920
Grandpa...

00:46:43.010 --> 00:46:44.800
I...

00:46:47.570 --> 00:46:48.890
I'm sorry!

00:46:50.330 --> 00:46:51.730
Tobio.

00:46:51.810 --> 00:46:54.400
Live your life the way you want.

00:46:54.490 --> 00:46:56.120
I'll...

00:46:56.210 --> 00:46:57.960
always be watching over you.

00:47:11.610 --> 00:47:12.960
Are you leaving already?

00:47:13.050 --> 00:47:13.960
Yeah.

00:47:14.050 --> 00:47:15.610
What are you guys going to do?

00:47:15.770 --> 00:47:17.520
After we bury Woonan,

00:47:17.610 --> 00:47:19.010
I'm going to go back to my oden shop.

00:47:19.090 --> 00:47:21.040
Well? Do you still want to be a pirate?

00:47:21.330 --> 00:47:22.360
Or...

00:47:22.530 --> 00:47:23.400
Sell oden?

00:47:24.810 --> 00:47:26.760
I'll think about it the next time I run away.

00:47:27.250 --> 00:47:29.040
If I take life seriously like grandpa,

00:47:29.130 --> 00:47:30.160
I'll definitely figure it out someday.

00:47:30.250 --> 00:47:31.000
Isn't that right?

00:47:32.170 --> 00:47:33.160
Right!

00:47:36.010 --> 00:47:37.240
How did you...?

00:47:38.010 --> 00:47:41.000
I took all of El Drago's treasure.

00:47:41.130 --> 00:47:43.080
You're the same as ever.

00:47:43.170 --> 00:47:44.160
That's right.

00:47:45.290 --> 00:47:47.880
Here's the money for the oden those two ate.

00:47:47.970 --> 00:47:49.000
It's a loan.

00:47:49.090 --> 00:47:50.000
A loan?

00:47:50.090 --> 00:47:52.040
Of course!
You owe me three times the amount.

00:47:52.170 --> 00:47:53.600
You little...

00:47:54.090 --> 00:47:56.240
No, I can't accept this money right now.

00:47:56.770 --> 00:47:58.640
Tobio and I decided

00:47:58.730 --> 00:48:00.360
that you should owe us the money

00:48:00.450 --> 00:48:02.120
interest-free.

00:48:02.210 --> 00:48:04.770
That way, we can meet again someday, right?

00:48:09.290 --> 00:48:11.120
So, why are you still lingering here?

00:48:11.250 --> 00:48:13.000
Get out of here while the weather's clear!

00:48:13.090 --> 00:48:15.080
You eat and run rascals!

00:48:17.730 --> 00:48:18.960
Farewell!

00:48:19.050 --> 00:48:22.080
Don't forget the great Captain Usopp!

00:48:22.570 --> 00:48:25.240
Take care, you two!

00:48:25.410 --> 00:48:27.440
We shall meet again!

00:48:43.890 --> 00:48:44.960
That guy

00:48:45.530 --> 00:48:47.760
truly will become the Pirate King.

00:48:48.370 --> 00:48:49.280
We'll see.

00:48:52.930 --> 00:48:55.160
Thanks, everyone!

00:48:55.970 --> 00:48:59.560
Thank you, Luffy!

00:49:03.890 --> 00:49:10.680
<i>Chiisana koro ni wa
\htakara no chizu ga </i>

00:49:03.890 --> 00:49:10.680
<i>\h\h\h\h\h\hWhen I was a child,
there was a treasure map</i>

00:49:11.130 --> 00:49:17.880
<i>Atama no naka ni ukandeite </i>

00:49:11.130 --> 00:49:17.880
<i>floating in my head.</i>

00:49:18.570 --> 00:49:25.170
<i>Itsudemo sagashita
\h\hkiseki no basho o </i>

00:49:18.570 --> 00:49:25.170
<i>\h\h\hAlways searching
for a wonderful place,</i>

00:49:25.490 --> 00:49:32.200
<i>Shiranai dareka ni makenai you ni</i>

00:49:25.490 --> 00:49:32.200
<i>\h\h\h\hso I could lose to
someone I didn't know.</i>

00:49:35.090 --> 00:49:45.040
<i>Ima de wa tame iki tsuite bakari de </i>

00:49:35.090 --> 00:49:45.040
<i>Nowadays, all I do is sigh.</i>

00:49:45.530 --> 00:49:49.410
<i>Daremo mada</i>

00:49:45.530 --> 00:49:49.410
<i>Nobody</i>

00:49:49.770 --> 00:49:53.920
<i>hontou no </i>

00:49:49.770 --> 00:49:53.920
<i>has had their dreams</i>

00:49:54.650 --> 00:50:00.960
<i>yume sae tsukamenai mama</i>

00:49:54.650 --> 00:50:00.960
<i>come true yet.</i>

00:50:01.330 --> 00:50:08.200
<i>Moshi mo jidai ga modoru no nara 
</i>

00:50:01.330 --> 00:50:08.200
<i>If the world changes,</i>

00:50:08.490 --> 00:50:15.320
<i>Namida o shitta koro no watashi ni 
</i>

00:50:08.490 --> 00:50:15.320
<i>take me back</i>

00:50:15.690 --> 00:50:22.560
<i>Tsurete itte omoide ga</i>

00:50:15.690 --> 00:50:22.560
<i>to the moment when I knew nothing,</i>

00:50:22.770 --> 00:50:29.720
<i>Tsurete itte setsunasa ga</i>

00:50:22.770 --> 00:50:29.720
<i>so my memories won't fade.</i>

00:50:30.170 --> 00:50:36.690
<i>Take me with you,</i>

00:50:30.170 --> 00:50:36.690
<i>Take me with you,</i>

00:50:37.170 --> 00:50:43.440
<i>oitsukanai you ni</i>

00:50:37.170 --> 00:50:43.440
<i>so the pain won't follow.</i>

